* Precision Reference Subsystem with ADR1399H and LTC6078 Buffer
* Primary supply input
VIN IN 0 15

* Floating supplies for the LTC6078 to respect its 5.5V max supply limit
* while allowing it to buffer a 7.05V signal. 
* VPLUS = 10V, VMINUS = 5V (Total supply = 5V, perfectly centering the 7.05V reference)
V2 VPLUS 0 10
V3 VMINUS 0 5

* ADR1399H Precision Shunt Reference
* Bias resistor for the Zener (approx 3mA)
R1 IN Z_PLUS 2.67k
* ADR1399H Subcircuit (Standard LTspice pin order: Zener+, Zener-, Heater+, Heater-)
X1 Z_PLUS 0 IN 0 ADR1399H

* LTC6078 Unity-Gain Buffer
* Standard LTspice op-amp pin order: IN+, IN-, V+, V-, OUT
X2 Z_PLUS OUT VPLUS VMINUS OUT LTC6078

* 1k Load on the buffered VREF output
Rload OUT 0 1k

* Analysis directive to measure the settled DC output
.tran 1

.end
